OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FDamp in
OL,6,Fplaces this evening with some light
OL,7,Frain for a time. Becoming dry
OL,8,Fovernight with skies clearing.
OL,9,FIsolated mist and fog patches may form
OL,10,Fin prone rural locations and here it
OL,11,Fwill turn chilly with perhaps some
OL,12,Fgrass frost.
OL,13,
OL,14,CSaturday:FA generally dry day to come
OL,15,Fwith sunny spells which could turn
OL,16,Fhazy at times with high cloud. Light
OL,17,Fwinds with temperatures a little above
OL,18,Faverage for September.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
