OL,5,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FTurning
OL,6,Fwindier on Sunday with rain edging
OL,7,Feastwards, heavy in places. Fine again
OL,8,Fon Monday with some sunshine before
OL,9,Fwet and windy weather returns on
OL,10,FTuesday. Temperatures staying above
OL,11,Faverage.
